## `spec` fields

These are the top-level fields of the ModelPolicy spec, the same as `spec:` in YAML. Nested objects are described in the
server's JSON Schema at `GET /v1/schemas` (also used by the UI builder for validation).

| Field | Type | | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `description` | string | optional |  |
| `allow_models` | list of string | optional | If set, only these models may run. |
| `deny_models` | list of string | optional |  |
| `difficulty_router` | object | optional | Optional score question; its level is matched by rules' match.difficulty. |
| `decision_provider` | string | optional |  |
| `rules` | list of object | **required** |  |

